                <pb facs="0742" n="628" sameAs="frus:frus1924v01/pg628"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">839.00/2835: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in the Dominican Republic</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Russell</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Santo Domingo</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1924-05-25T12:00:00-04:40"><hi rendition="#italic">May 25,
                                1924—noon</hi></date>.<lb/>[Received May 26—10:15
                    a.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>16. The Government has named the following plenipotentiaries for the negotiation
                    of the treaty provided for in the Plan of Evacuation: Horacio Vasquez,
                    President-elect; Federico Velasquez, Vice President-elect; and Francisco J.
                    Peynado.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Russell</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
